 "story": "Liverpool beat Atlético Madrid 2-1 at Anfield, a win that lifted them to ninth in the Champions League table. Atlético Madrid took the lead in the 17th minute, when Marcos Llorente scored from a Julián Álvarez assist. Dominik Szoboszlai levelled for Liverpool in the 40th minute with an assist from Ronald Araujo, and the sides went in at 1-1 at half-time. Alexis Mac Allister put Liverpool 2-1 ahead in the 50th minute, set up by Alexander Isak. Atlético Madrid had 54.7% of possession, but Liverpool had 14 shots to their nine. Five of Liverpool's shots were on target, against four from Atlético Madrid.",
